    <!-- 运动健康 -->
    <section class="view" id="view-health">
<div class="section-intro">作息、运动、身心状态，生活琐事清单。关照好自己的身体与情绪，经营一份松弛稳定的校园日常。</div>
      <div class="page-head">
        <h1><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg>运动健康</h1>
        <p>当前→目标（点击填写） · 可持续跟练 · 饮食红绿灯</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="metric"><div class="label">身高 (cm)</div><div class="value" id="userHeight" contenteditable="true" style="cursor:text">点击填写</div><div class="sub">决定 BMI 基准</div></div>
        <div class="metric"><div class="label">当前体重(kg)</div><div class="value" id="curWeight" contenteditable="true" style="cursor:text">点击填写</div><div class="sub" id="curBmi">BMI待测算</div></div>
        <div class="metric"><div class="label">目标体重</div><div class="value" id="goalWeight" contenteditable="true" style="cursor:text">点击填写</div><div class="sub" id="goalBmi">待测算</div></div>
        <div class="metric"><div class="label">周期</div><div class="value" id="planWeeks" contenteditable="true" style="cursor:text">点击填写</div><div class="sub" id="weeklyPace">每周节奏自定</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>每日跟练视频（B站直链）</h3>
          <p>零基础也能跟、强度循序渐进、对关节友好。每次运动结构：热身10分钟 + 主练40分钟 + 拉伸10分钟。</p>
